Time [EventController]
Shows the current simulation time of the simulation run in the box next to Time.
Remarks
Click Time to change the display of the time between the
• Relative time
Plant Simulation resets the relative time to zero, when it starts the simulation run. This is the default.
Here the EventController shows the simulation time next to the button Time.
• Current time plus simulation time
Plant Simulation adds the simulation time to the time and date at which it started the simulation run.
Here the EventController shows the current time plus the simulation time next to the button Time.
Let us assume that today is the second of January 2023, six o'clock in the morning and that the simulation
is to run for two days.
• For the setting relative time the time display shows 2:00:00:0000, i.e., two days.
• For the setting current time plus simulation time the time display shows Mi, 2023/01/04
06:00:00.0000, i.e., Wednesday, January 04, 2023, 6 o'clock in the morning.
