To decrease the speed of the simulation, drag it to the left or press the left arrow key.
Decreasing the speed enables you to better follow the movements of MUs, as Plant Simulation shows their
icons for a longer time on the same station.
This has the same effect as dragging the Simulation Speed Slider on the Home ribbon tab.
