End Time [EventController]
Type in the End Time at which the simulation will be finished. Type in a relative time, i.e., the period of
time during which the simulation runs.
Remarks
Plant Simulation compares this period with the simulation time and stops the simulation run, when both
are identical.
Let us assume that today is July 04, 12 o’clock noon and that the simulation is to run for two days.
To make the simulation run for two days, type in 2:00:00:00. If you do not want to write this out in
full, you can also just type 2::: and click Apply to make the program translate this to the full format
2:00:00:00.
