Statistics [EventController]
Type in the point in time at which the EventController starts collecting statistics data.
Remarks
Plant Simulation resets statistics and deletes all statistics values it collected up to that time and starts
collecting new statistical data for all material flow objects from this time on.
This way you can discard data collected during the warm-up phase, which might distort the simulation
results.
