Single Step Simulation [EventDebugger]
To process the next simulation event in line, to stop the simulation afterward, and to thus proceed through
your model step-by-step, click this button.
Remarks
To debug all methods and formulas, which are executed while the event is being processed, hold down
Shift while clicking Step. Plant Simulation opens the Method Debugger for all executed controls,
formulas and for suspended methods, which were woken up. Clicking Debug Next Simulation Step 
does the same.
The button does the same as the Single Step Simulation button in the EventController.
