Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Step Halts Additionally Before Event
To stop twice if the next event in the Event List is in the future, select this check box.
Remarks
The first Single Step (F10) jumps the simulation time to the event.
The second Single Step executes the event and stops immediately afterward. If the next event occurs at
the same simulation time though, Plant Simulation does not stop in addition.
You can use this setting if you want to investigate the state of the model, for example the exact position of
parts on a Conveyor, at the time at which the next event will be executed.
Step Halts Additionally Before Event is cleared by default, meaning that Single Step Animation stops
once after each event.
See also
Event List
Step Halts Additionally Before Event
